            "popup_title": "The Tuttle Twins Learn About Economics",
            "popup_description": "<ul><li>Introduces basic economic ideas like supply, demand, and incentives through a fun story</li><li>Follows Ethan and Emily as they run a food truck and face real-world business challenges</li><li>Helps kids understand how regulations and choices impact prices, jobs, and opportunity</li></ul>"
