            "description": "<p>Based on <em>I, Pencil by Leonard Read.</em></p>",
            "recommended_ages": "5-12",
            "popup_title": "The Tuttle Twins Learn About Markets & Cooperation",
            "popup_description": "<ul><li>Introduces core economic ideas like free markets, division of labor, and voluntary cooperation through story.</li><li>Follows Ethan and Emily as they discover how people around the world work together to create something as simple as a pencil.</li><li>Shows kids how everyday items are made without a central plan—making big economic concepts easy, engaging, and memorable.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
