            "popup_title": "The Tuttle Twins Learn About The Law",
            "popup_description": "<ul><li>Teaches children the origin of individual rights and personal responsibility.</li><li>Follows Ethan and Emily as they make the law easy to understand.</li><li>Sparks critical thinking about the role of government versus private aid.</li></ul>"
