        "review_item_EnmKaa": {
          "type": "review-item",
          "settings": {
            "reviewtext": "<p>“My son doesn't like to read, but he devours these books over and over again. Kudos to Connor and his team for finding the secret sauce to get my son interested in learning.“</p>",
            "title": "Peter R"
          }
        },
        "review_item_kePY6b": {
          "type": "review-item",
          "settings": {
            "reviewtext": "<p>“Forget 5-11 year olds… when I read these books to my kids I learned all sorts of stuff nobody ever taught me. Now my kids and I have some awesome discussions together!“</p>",
            "title": "Josie A"
          }
        },
        "review_item_9byWHP": {
          "type": "review-item",
          "settings": {
            "reviewtext": "<p>“I wasn't sure my kids would enjoy the workbooks but it turns out they've been awesome and my kids love the activities. Highly recommended!“</p>",
            "title": "Maya T"
          }
        },
        "review_item_x7UPCU": {
          "type": "review-item",
          "settings": {
            "reviewtext": "<p>“Our family loves the Tuttle Twins. We started watching on Angel studios and have shared it with family members. When I found out that they have a curriculum I jumped at the opportunity to buy this set. The books arrived quickly and in perfect condition. Plus the email came with any other information we needed. We look forward to learning with this curriculum..“</p>",
            "title": "Melena M."
          }
        },
        "review_item_N9tKkh": {
          "type": "review-item",
          "settings": {
            "reviewtext": "<p>\"The kids love having the variety of topics and are learning so much, with FUN READING! Keep up the great job Tuttle Twins!\"</p>",
            "title": "Lauri M."
          }
        },
        "review_item_7GgVW8": {
          "type": "review-item",
          "settings": {
            "reviewtext": "<p>\"I love these books, we haven't even finished going through them all and between the books and the show on Angel she is already applying what she has learned to other things and it is amazing to see!</p><p>For example, the book about the pencil and how it is made actually taught her how the Bible was made and made it easy for her to understand.\"</p>",
            "title": "Austin M."
          }
        }
      },
